{"completed": true, "response": "原本稍稍安定下来的心绪，此刻又开始泛起波澜。声音渐渐变得密集，内里仿佛有一股暗流在不断翻涌、攀升，催促着音乐向前。那份平静并没有真正消除心底的渴望，反而让未曾填满的空缺变得更加清晰。情绪一点点升温，心跳似乎也随之加快，柔软的旋律中透出越来越强烈的迫切。奇妙的是，这种激动并不显得粗暴，依然带着温润的光泽，甚至有一种令人心动的明亮。像是长久压抑的情感终于找到了出口，却又无法一下子倾尽，只能随着一波波起伏不断向外涌出。越是向上，越能感到那份渴望的深切；越是明亮，越隐约察觉平静背后始终存在的失落。", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-5f2100a6f24c4bb1a933044d93042590", "response_sha256": "e5033754a0475280c7ced147acc0d2438967e54d93c9cfab83a5b69eaffe9000", "session_handle": "4a17a799-91ad-4203-b419-a74d2b385dfd", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 0.767, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 6.962}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 72, "first_assistant_seconds": 0.297, "first_text_seconds": 0.297, "stream_seconds": 9.735, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 65}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_success": false, "tool_result_observations": [], "reasoning_observations": [{"finished_duratio